        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2104, Classic Passage Mortise Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Classic Pocket Door Passage Set comes packaged with two pulls--one for each side of the door--a mortise box, and all the mounting hardware. It has a timeless appearance that makes it a great choice for almost any home. Perfect for pocket doors, the Emtek made 2104 Classic Passage Mortise Pocket Door Hardware is installed by mortising it into the door. Choose from a wide array of beautiful finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Passage Function:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features two flush pulls and a mortise box with a built in finger edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/classic-pocket-door-dummy-set-emtek-2106\"><b>Dummy Set</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/classic-pocket-door-privacy-set-emtek-2105\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/classic-pocket-door-keyed-entry-emtek-2103\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Classic Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Face Plate Height: 7-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 5-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 17/20\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise faceplate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2105-specifications.pdf?v=1704262358\"><b>Emtek 2104 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) rectangle flush pulls, a passage set mortise pull, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
